1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,130
(Penny:)Why are you smiling?

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:05,840
I'm sorry, it's just I never think of you
having feelings like that.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,370
- Well, I do.
- Why?

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:10,170
(Leonard:)Nothing is ever going to happen
between me and Alex.

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,810
(Leonard:)Good.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,920
(Leonard:)Come here.

7
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:20,170
- Can I tell you a secret?
- What's that?

8
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:24,600
(Leonard:)With all these women chasing me,
I kind of do feel like Captain Kirk.

9
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:27,000
- Can I tell you a secret?
- Sure.

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,760
(Penny:)Keep talking about Captain Kirk
and we're all gonna stop.

11
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,640
(Leonard:)Message. Received.

12
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,330
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

13
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,290
(Sheldon:)Hello.

14
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,520
(Leonard:)This is Dr. Hofstadter.

15
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,890
(Alex:)Okay.

16
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,760
(Leonard:)All right, thank you.

17
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:57,020
(Leonard:)That's weird.
I'm getting called into Human Resources.

